{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UcH6Ep9mpvNxQw5ubBShHK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// BattleSim: a hex battle as plain JSON state. It never touches the engine, the DOM, the clock or Math.random: the same\n2\t// setup and the same commands always give the same events (the tests check it). Two sides fight across a board of\n3\t// hexes for up to a set number of bells. In each bell every living unit acts once, fastest first. A unit may move, then\n4\t// attack, use a skill or wait. Side 0 attacks: it wins by a knight standing on the Keep, or by routing side 1. Side 1\n5\t// holds: it wins when the bells run out, or by routing side 0. Either side loses when its commander falls.\n6\t(() => {\n7\t  const H = G;\n8\t\n9\t  // ---- building a unit from a knight or a monster ----\n10\t  H.makeUnit = (spec, side, uid) => {\n11\t    const base = { uid, side, kind: spec.kind, ref: spec.ref, leader: !!spec.leader, campaignId: spec._id || null, q: 0, r: 0, dead: false,\n12\t      moved: false, acted: false, cd: 0, xp: 0, status: { slow: 0, guard: 0, rally: 0, charge: 0 }, items: (spec.items || []).slice() };"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"43d2116f-5b09-4110-a648-b4dc3a22f8eb","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:36:03.369Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050229/src/20-sim-battle.js","content":"// BattleSim: a hex battle as plain JSON state. It never touches the engine, the DOM, the clock or Math.random: the same\n// setup and the same commands always give the same events (the tests check it). Two sides fight across a board of\n// hexes for up to a set number of bells. In each bell every living unit acts once, fastest first. A unit may move, then\n// attack, use a skill or wait. Side 0 attacks: it wins by a knight standing on the Keep, or by routing side 1. Side 1\n// holds: it wins when the bells run out, or by routing side 0. Either side loses when its commander falls.\n(() => {\n  const H = G;\n\n  // ---- building a unit from a knight or a monster ----\n  H.makeUnit = (spec, side, uid) => {\n    const base = { uid, side, kind: spec.kind, ref: spec.ref, leader: !!spec.leader, campaignId: spec._id || null, q: 0, r: 0, dead: false,\n      moved: false, acted: false, cd: 0, xp: 0, status: { slow: 0, guard: 0, rally: 0, charge: 0 }, items: (spec.items || []).slice() };","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":387}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UcH6Ep9mpvNxQw5ubBShHK","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
