{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghvj6R25768iMxZF6i6i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Stillness test now checks the refusal directly and passes. Next are the bespoke beast rigs: quadruped, drake, avian and serpent bodies, with the walk, flap and sway motion and the same update-and-draw interface as the engine's rigs. I'll also give those species their bodies, and feed the facing angle to the non-humanoid rigs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1432,"cache_read_input_tokens":709940,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1432},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"96eaee56-3d55-4354-8956-59acc896df65","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:58:28.500Z","request_id":"req_011Cghvj63CZ8FfcAdamkvnS"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghvj6R25768iMxZF6i6i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014mbH838NcYbX7bHiVzLaDQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > src/31-art-beasts.js <<'EOF'\n// Beast rigs: the monsters that are animals rather than blobs or skeletons. Four bodies: a quadruped (four legs, a tail,\n// ears), a drake (a long neck, a head with horns, two wings, two legs), an avian (round body, feathered wings, a beak) and\n// a serpent (a body of segments moving in a wave). They share the interface of the engine's rigs: update(dt, state) poses\n// them from plain state (walk, flap, facing), draw(g, ox, oy, view) draws inside r.actor, and drawPortrait(g, x, y, size)\n// draws one still. Everything is drawn with the engine's pixel primitives: no image files.\n(() => {\n  const H = G, px = E.px;\n\n  class Beast {\n    constructor(o = {}) {\n      this.body = o.body || 'quadruped';\n      this.c = Object.assign({ dk: '#3a2a1a', base: '#8a6a4a', lt: '#c8a880', eye: '#ffe060', pupil: '#100a04' }, o.colors || {});\n      this.size = o.size || 1;\n      this.t = 0; this.walk = 0; this.flap = 1; this.face = 1; this.squash = 0;\n    }\n    update(dt, st = {}) {\n      this.t += dt;\n      this.walk = st.walk || 0;\n      this.flap = st.flap === undefined ? 1 : st.flap;\n      if (st.facing !== undefined) this.face = Math.cos(st.facing) < 0 ? -1 : 1;\n      this.squash = st.squash || 0;\n    }\n    // the body's parts in its own frame (x forward, y up), scaled by size; the feet are at y = 0\n    draw(g, ox, oy) { this.paint(g, ox, oy, this.walk, this.t, this.flap); }\n    drawPortrait(g, x, y, size) { this.paint(g, x, y, 0, this.t, 0.4, size / 24); }\n    paint(g, ox, oy, walk, t, flap, scale = 1) {\n      const s = this.size * scale * (1 + this.squash), f = this.face, c = this.c;\n      const P = (x, y) => [Math.round(ox + f * x * s), Math.round(oy - y * s)];\n      const wave = Math.sin(t * (walk ? 12 : 3));\n      const body = (cx, cy, rx, ry, col) => { const [x, y] = P(cx, cy); px.ell(g, x, y, Math.max(1, Math.round(rx * s)), Math.max(1, Math.round(ry * s)), col); };\n      const line = (a, b, col, w = 1) => { const [x0, y0] = P(a[0], a[1]), [x1, y1] = P(b[0], b[1]); px.line(g, x0, y0, x1, y1, col, w); };\n      const disc = (x, y, r, col) => { const [px0, py0] = P(x, y); px.disc(g, px0, py0, Math.max(1, Math.round(r * s)), col); };\n      if (this.body === 'quadruped') {\n        // four legs swing in pairs as it walks; a tail sways; the head is forward and up\n        const sw = walk ? wave * 3 : 0;\n        for (const x of [-7, 6]) { line([x, 5], [x + sw, 0], c.dk, 2); line([x + 1, 5], [x - sw * .5 + 1, 0], c.dk, 2); }\n        body(0, 8, 9, 5, c.base); body(0, 6, 9, 3, c.lt);\n        disc(9, 13, 4.5, c.base);\n        line([9, 13], [11, 17], c.base, 2);\n        line([-9, 10], [-12, 13 + wave * 1.5], c.dk, 2);\n        disc(12, 15, 0.9, c.eye);\n      } else if (this.body === 'drake') {\n        // two legs, two wings beating, a long neck to a horned head, a barbed tail\n        const beat = Math.sin(t * 6) * 6 * (flap || 0);\n        body(0, 9, 8, 5, c.base);\n        line([-4, 10], [-6, 6 + beat * .3], c.dk, 3); line([4, 10], [6, 6 + beat * .2], c.dk, 3);\n        line([0, 12], [-8, 22 + beat], c.dk, 2); line([0, 12], [8, 22 + beat * .6], c.lt, 2);\n        line([-9, 9], [-16, 9 + wave], c.dk, 2);\n        line([6, 12], [11, 20], c.base, 3); disc(13, 22, 4, c.base);\n        line([15, 25], [18, 29], c.dk, 1); line([11, 25], [9, 29], c.dk, 1);\n        disc(16, 23, 1, c.eye);\n      } else if (this.body === 'avian') {\n        // a round body on two thin legs, feathered wings that beat, a beak\n        const beat = Math.sin(t * 8) * 5 * (flap || 0);\n        body(0, 8, 6, 6, c.base); body(0, 7, 4, 3, c.lt);\n        line([-2, 2], [-3, 0], c.dk, 1); line([2, 2], [3, 0], c.dk, 1);\n        line([-3, 9], [-11, 13 + beat], c.dk, 3); line([-11, 13 + beat], [-14, 6 + beat], c.base, 2);\n        line([3, 9], [9, 12 - beat * .4], c.dk, 3);\n        disc(5, 13, 3.5, c.base); line([7, 13], [11, 12], c.eye, 1);\n        disc(6, 14, 0.8, c.pupil);\n      } else {\n        // a serpent: segments on a wave, its head forward; the wave runs along the body while it moves\n        const seg = 7;\n        for (let i = 0; i < seg; i++) {\n          const x = -i * 3.4, y = 3 + Math.sin(t * (walk ? 8 : 2) - i * .9) * 3;\n          const r = 4.2 - i * .35;\n          disc(x, y, Math.max(1.2, r), i % 2 ? c.base : c.lt);\n        }\n        disc(3, 4 + Math.sin(t * (walk ? 8 : 2)) * 1.5, 4.6, c.base);\n        disc(5.4, 5.5, 1, c.eye);\n        line([7, 4], [10, 2], c.dk, 1);\n      }\n    }\n    // a point to breathe from, or to launch a missile at, in the rig's own frame (its mouth)\n    mouth() { return { x: this.face * 12 * this.size, y: 14 * this.size }; }\n    tip() { return { x: this.face * 16 * this.size, y: 16 * this.size }; }\n  }\n  H.Beast = Beast;\n})();\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ndef patch(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        c=s.count(a); assert c==1,(p,c,a[:80]); s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\npatch('src/30-art.js', [(\"    if (look.kind === 'blob') {\",\n \"    if (look.kind === 'beast') return { rig: new H.Beast({ body: look.body, colors: look.colors, size: 1 + (unit.form || 0) * .12 }), kind: 'beast', moves: ['slash'] };\\n    if (look.kind === 'blob') {\")])\npatch('src/60-board.js', [(\"          R.rig.update(dt, { squash: -strike * .3, look: [Math.cos(v.facing) * .4, Math.sin(v.facing) * .4], walk: moving === u.uid ? 1 : 0, flap: u.dead ? 0 : 1 });\",\n \"          R.rig.update(dt, { squash: -strike * .3, look: [Math.cos(v.facing) * .4, Math.sin(v.facing) * .4], facing: v.facing, walk: moving === u.uid ? 1 : 0, flap: u.dead ? 0 : 1 });\")])\ns=open('src/13-data-content.js').read()\nrep={\"FAMILY('ember-fox', 'Ember Fox', 'solar', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('ember-fox', 'Ember Fox', 'solar', BL('beast', { body: 'quadruped'\",\n \"FAMILY('sun-hound', 'Sun Hound', 'solar', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('sun-hound', 'Sun Hound', 'solar', BL('beast', { body: 'quadruped'\",\n \"FAMILY('glass-serpent', 'Glass Serpent', 'rime', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('glass-serpent', 'Glass Serpent', 'rime', BL('beast', { body: 'serpent'\",\n \"FAMILY('tide-eel', 'Tide Eel', 'rime', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('tide-eel', 'Tide Eel', 'rime', BL('beast', { body: 'serpent'\",\n \"FAMILY('drake-whelp', 'Drake Whelp', 'solar', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('drake-whelp', 'Drake Whelp', 'solar', BL('beast', { body: 'drake'\",\n \"FAMILY('gloom-owl', 'Gloom Owl', 'ambered', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('gloom-owl', 'Gloom Owl', 'ambered', BL('beast', { body: 'avian'\",\n \"FAMILY('salt-gull', 'Salt Gull', 'ambered', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('salt-gull', 'Salt Gull', 'ambered', BL('beast', { body: 'avian'\",\n \"FAMILY('lantern-moth', 'Lantern Moth', 'ambered', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('lantern-moth', 'Lantern Moth', 'ambered', BL('beast', { body: 'avian'\",\n}\nfor a,b in rep.items():\n    assert s.count(a)==1,a[:40]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen('src/13-data-content.js','w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | grep -v \"^    at\" | head -4","description":"Add bespoke beast rigs and give eight species animal bodies"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1432,"cache_read_input_tokens":709940,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1432},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"b2999a58-564b-4620-ad39-d359c91d4413","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:58:42.057Z","request_id":"req_011Cghvj63CZ8FfcAdamkvnS","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_014mbH838NcYbX7bHiVzLaDQ":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050229 && cat > src/31-art-beasts.js <<'EOF'\n// Beast rigs: the monsters that are animals rather than blobs or skeletons. Four bodies: a quadruped (four legs, a tail,\n// ears), a drake (a long neck, a head with horns, two wings, two legs), an avian (round body, feathered wings, a beak) and\n// a serpent (a body of segments moving in a wave). They share the interface of the engine's rigs: update(dt, state) poses\n// them from plain state (walk, flap, facing), draw(g, ox, oy, view) draws inside r.actor, and drawPortrait(g, x, y, size)\n// draws one still. Everything is drawn with the engine's pixel primitives: no image files.\n(() => {\n  const H = G, px = E.px;\n\n  class Beast {\n    constructor(o = {}) {\n      this.body = o.body || 'quadruped';\n      this.c = Object.assign({ dk: '#3a2a1a', base: '#8a6a4a', lt: '#c8a880', eye: '#ffe060', pupil: '#100a04' }, o.colors || {});\n      this.size = o.size || 1;\n      this.t = 0; this.walk = 0; this.flap = 1; this.face = 1; this.squash = 0;\n    }\n    update(dt, st = {}) {\n      this.t += dt;\n      this.walk = st.walk || 0;\n      this.flap = st.flap === undefined ? 1 : st.flap;\n      if (st.facing !== undefined) this.face = Math.cos(st.facing) < 0 ? -1 : 1;\n      this.squash = st.squash || 0;\n    }\n    // the body's parts in its own frame (x forward, y up), scaled by size; the feet are at y = 0\n    draw(g, ox, oy) { this.paint(g, ox, oy, this.walk, this.t, this.flap); }\n    drawPortrait(g, x, y, size) { this.paint(g, x, y, 0, this.t, 0.4, size / 24); }\n    paint(g, ox, oy, walk, t, flap, scale = 1) {\n      const s = this.size * scale * (1 + this.squash), f = this.face, c = this.c;\n      const P = (x, y) => [Math.round(ox + f * x * s), Math.round(oy - y * s)];\n      const wave = Math.sin(t * (walk ? 12 : 3));\n      const body = (cx, cy, rx, ry, col) => { const [x, y] = P(cx, cy); px.ell(g, x, y, Math.max(1, Math.round(rx * s)), Math.max(1, Math.round(ry * s)), col); };\n      const line = (a, b, col, w = 1) => { const [x0, y0] = P(a[0], a[1]), [x1, y1] = P(b[0], b[1]); px.line(g, x0, y0, x1, y1, col, w); };\n      const disc = (x, y, r, col) => { const [px0, py0] = P(x, y); px.disc(g, px0, py0, Math.max(1, Math.round(r * s)), col); };\n      if (this.body === 'quadruped') {\n        // four legs swing in pairs as it walks; a tail sways; the head is forward and up\n        const sw = walk ? wave * 3 : 0;\n        for (const x of [-7, 6]) { line([x, 5], [x + sw, 0], c.dk, 2); line([x + 1, 5], [x - sw * .5 + 1, 0], c.dk, 2); }\n        body(0, 8, 9, 5, c.base); body(0, 6, 9, 3, c.lt);\n        disc(9, 13, 4.5, c.base);\n        line([9, 13], [11, 17], c.base, 2);\n        line([-9, 10], [-12, 13 + wave * 1.5], c.dk, 2);\n        disc(12, 15, 0.9, c.eye);\n      } else if (this.body === 'drake') {\n        // two legs, two wings beating, a long neck to a horned head, a barbed tail\n        const beat = Math.sin(t * 6) * 6 * (flap || 0);\n        body(0, 9, 8, 5, c.base);\n        line([-4, 10], [-6, 6 + beat * .3], c.dk, 3); line([4, 10], [6, 6 + beat * .2], c.dk, 3);\n        line([0, 12], [-8, 22 + beat], c.dk, 2); line([0, 12], [8, 22 + beat * .6], c.lt, 2);\n        line([-9, 9], [-16, 9 + wave], c.dk, 2);\n        line([6, 12], [11, 20], c.base, 3); disc(13, 22, 4, c.base);\n        line([15, 25], [18, 29], c.dk, 1); line([11, 25], [9, 29], c.dk, 1);\n        disc(16, 23, 1, c.eye);\n      } else if (this.body === 'avian') {\n        // a round body on two thin legs, feathered wings that beat, a beak\n        const beat = Math.sin(t * 8) * 5 * (flap || 0);\n        body(0, 8, 6, 6, c.base); body(0, 7, 4, 3, c.lt);\n        line([-2, 2], [-3, 0], c.dk, 1); line([2, 2], [3, 0], c.dk, 1);\n        line([-3, 9], [-11, 13 + beat], c.dk, 3); line([-11, 13 + beat], [-14, 6 + beat], c.base, 2);\n        line([3, 9], [9, 12 - beat * .4], c.dk, 3);\n        disc(5, 13, 3.5, c.base); line([7, 13], [11, 12], c.eye, 1);\n        disc(6, 14, 0.8, c.pupil);\n      } else {\n        // a serpent: segments on a wave, its head forward; the wave runs along the body while it moves\n        const seg = 7;\n        for (let i = 0; i < seg; i++) {\n          const x = -i * 3.4, y = 3 + Math.sin(t * (walk ? 8 : 2) - i * .9) * 3;\n          const r = 4.2 - i * .35;\n          disc(x, y, Math.max(1.2, r), i % 2 ? c.base : c.lt);\n        }\n        disc(3, 4 + Math.sin(t * (walk ? 8 : 2)) * 1.5, 4.6, c.base);\n        disc(5.4, 5.5, 1, c.eye);\n        line([7, 4], [10, 2], c.dk, 1);\n      }\n    }\n    // a point to breathe from, or to launch a missile at, in the rig's own frame (its mouth)\n    mouth() { return { x: this.face * 12 * this.size, y: 14 * this.size }; }\n    tip() { return { x: this.face * 16 * this.size, y: 16 * this.size }; }\n  }\n  H.Beast = Beast;\n})();\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ndef patch(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        c=s.count(a); assert c==1,(p,c,a[:80]); s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\npatch('src/30-art.js', [(\"    if (look.kind === 'blob') {\",\n \"    if (look.kind === 'beast') return { rig: new H.Beast({ body: look.body, colors: look.colors, size: 1 + (unit.form || 0) * .12 }), kind: 'beast', moves: ['slash'] };\\n    if (look.kind === 'blob') {\")])\npatch('src/60-board.js', [(\"          R.rig.update(dt, { squash: -strike * .3, look: [Math.cos(v.facing) * .4, Math.sin(v.facing) * .4], walk: moving === u.uid ? 1 : 0, flap: u.dead ? 0 : 1 });\",\n \"          R.rig.update(dt, { squash: -strike * .3, look: [Math.cos(v.facing) * .4, Math.sin(v.facing) * .4], facing: v.facing, walk: moving === u.uid ? 1 : 0, flap: u.dead ? 0 : 1 });\")])\ns=open('src/13-data-content.js').read()\nrep={\"FAMILY('ember-fox', 'Ember Fox', 'solar', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('ember-fox', 'Ember Fox', 'solar', BL('beast', { body: 'quadruped'\",\n \"FAMILY('sun-hound', 'Sun Hound', 'solar', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('sun-hound', 'Sun Hound', 'solar', BL('beast', { body: 'quadruped'\",\n \"FAMILY('glass-serpent', 'Glass Serpent', 'rime', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('glass-serpent', 'Glass Serpent', 'rime', BL('beast', { body: 'serpent'\",\n \"FAMILY('tide-eel', 'Tide Eel', 'rime', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('tide-eel', 'Tide Eel', 'rime', BL('beast', { body: 'serpent'\",\n \"FAMILY('drake-whelp', 'Drake Whelp', 'solar', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('drake-whelp', 'Drake Whelp', 'solar', BL('beast', { body: 'drake'\",\n \"FAMILY('gloom-owl', 'Gloom Owl', 'ambered', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('gloom-owl', 'Gloom Owl', 'ambered', BL('beast', { body: 'avian'\",\n \"FAMILY('salt-gull', 'Salt Gull', 'ambered', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('salt-gull', 'Salt Gull', 'ambered', BL('beast', { body: 'avian'\",\n \"FAMILY('lantern-moth', 'Lantern Moth', 'ambered', BL('blob'\":\"FAMILY('lantern-moth', 'Lantern Moth', 'ambered', BL('beast', { body: 'avian'\",\n}\nfor a,b in rep.items():\n    assert s.count(a)==1,a[:40]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen('src/13-data-content.js','w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | grep -v \"^    at\" | head -4","description":"Add bespoke beast rigs and give eight species animal bodies"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_014mbH838NcYbX7bHiVzLaDQ":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050229"}}}
