nd before the frost takes both.' }, { who: 'hale', text: 'Settle it, then. The frost is patient, and I am not.' }],\n  'vesper-oren': [{ who: 'vesper', text: 'Oren, you keep your clock broken. I have come to mend it, under my own hand.' }, { who: 'oren', text: 'You have never mended anything in your life, Regent. You only stop it.' }],\n  'tamsin-vesper': [{ who: 'vesper', text: 'Sun-Queen, you burn the hour in every dawn. Let me stop it for you.' }, { who: 'tamsin', text: 'You will not stop a sunrise, Regent. You can only be burned by one.' }],\n  'vesper-wren': [{ who: 'wren', text: 'Vesper, the harvest bells have stopped ringing. What did you do to my fields?' }, { who: 'vesper', text: 'I did nothing to them. They simply stopped waiting for you.' }],\n  'hale-vesper': [{ who: 'hale', text: 'Vesper, the frost takes what it likes, and it does not like you.' }, { who: 'vesper', text: 'Frost is only time that has forgotten how to move. I shall remind it.' }]\n};\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ndef patch(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        c=s.count(a); assert c==1,(p,c,a[:90]); s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\npatch('src/62-campaign.js', [\n (\"    startBattle(pending) {\\n      const cs = ses.cs, march = pending.march;\",\n  \"    startBattle(pending) {\\n      const cs = ses.cs, march = pending.march;\\n      // two rulers on the field trade their lines first; each pair does so once\\n      const ra = cs.realmRuler(march.by), rb = cs.realmRuler(cs.ownerOf(march.to));\\n      const key = [ra, rb].sort().join('-');\\n      if (ra && rb && H.RIVAL_LINES[key] && !cs.s.flags['rival-' + key]) {\\n        cs.s.flags['rival-' + key] = true;\\n        this.game.go('event', { lines: H.RIVAL_LINES[key], sky: ['#1a1428', '#3a2a50'], next: { scene: 'campaign', data: { resumeBattle: true } } });\\n        return;\\n      }\"),\n])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\necho patched","description":"Add rival lines before battles, once per pair of rulers"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_011jKHCTSV5BZ9NjqBZbVSWk":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050229"}}}
