{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghxwYhPKa18m1jsKiWfY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All four hub scenarios pass on the final build, and my server is stopped. Last, I'll bring the About text and the exit interview in line with the final state. Only two items remain open: the sound-effect set is smaller than the plan's list, and balance is a first tuning that the dev sliders can adjust."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1115,"cache_read_input_tokens":811426,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1115},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"63078e0f-5bc7-4d4f-880b-e2239c93457b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:27:18.126Z","request_id":"req_011CghxwYFMZiBogBtBkAfEs"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghxwYhPKa18m1jsKiWfY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016t4CzKfFXdtwuyekuFnrqW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, re\np='src/12-data-story.js'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    c=s.count(a); assert c==1,(c,a[:70]); s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"'Testing: 538 headless checks\",\"'Testing: 539 headless checks\")\ni=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\"); j=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Testing feedback'\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\n    'Nothing the brief or the plan lists is left unbuilt. Two things are smaller than the plan: the sound-effect set (the plan lists more named effects), and the balance, which is a first tuning. Planner battles now end about 63% on time, 33% with the attacker\\\\'s commander falling, and 4% on the Keep. The dev sliders (battle damage, hit chance, counter-attack, defenders\\\\' guard, knight experience) are the place to adjust it.'] },\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\nrep(\"    'Hardest: keeping the scope honest.\",\"    'Hardest: keeping the scope honest.\") if \"    'Hardest: keeping the scope honest.\" in s else None\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nd=json.load(open('exit-interview.json'))\nd['sourceInformation']['testing']=\"539 headless checks (node tests/run.mjs), five browser playthroughs through the real scenes (node tests/run.mjs --browser), balance runs, Playwright screenshots, and the AI Hub harness in shared-world mode with 2 and 4 players under latency and loss, with a host leaving, and with a host that has no player\"\nd['sourceInformation']['animation']=\"The engine's rigs and E.move attack states, poses and walks; beast rigs with walk, wing and sway motion; a bell-by-bell battle event queue (walks, strikes, hurts, deaths, captures, dial turns); a season wipe on the campaign map\"\nd['promptFeedback'][2]=\"Keeping the scope honest. Every feature the brief names is built, and the plan's mechanics and content counts are built too. What is left is a smaller sound-effect set and a first balance tuning, which the dev sliders expose.\"\nd['testingFeedback'][0]=\"Fourteen issues across all rounds. Nine in the first round (seven broke play, two were cosmetic); two in the hub harness; and three in the playthroughs and review: a campaign that never advanced its season, a battle that could not restart after its rival lines, and a balance rule (the Keep won mid-move) that the plan puts at the end of the last bell.\"\njson.dump(d,open('/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/exit-interview.json','w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\nprint('json ok', len(d['testingFeedback']), len(d['engineFeedback']), len(d['promptFeedback']))\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs | tail -1; ls -la .. | grep -i \"html\\|exit-interview\" | cut -c1-160","description":"Update About text and exit interview to the final state, rebuild and verify root files"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1115,"cache_read_input_tokens":811426,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1115},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"06106c24-6619-40e1-83c3-da64697cb800","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:27:22.881Z","request_id":"req_011CghxwYFMZiBogBtBkAfEs","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_016t4CzKfFXdtwuyekuFnrqW":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050229 && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, re\np