{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyWeK9TFDgKo8XWvb6u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the measured results against the plan's §14.5 targets:\n\n- **AI-only campaigns:** average 9.2 seasons, against a target of 12–16. No realm wins more than 40%.\n- **Player on autoplay:** wins 5 of 16 (31%), against a target of at least 60% reaching Meridian between seasons 10 and 14.\n- **Battle length:** averages 11.7 bells, against a target of 8 or fewer in early battles.\n- **Hub seats:** not measured.\n\nSo three of the balance targets are unmet. I'll say that plainly in the About text and the exit interview. Then I'll run the full suites and the browser playthroughs on the final build, since the sound and balance changes touch the play paths."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_read_input_tokens":861280,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"c9bdfcbc-03d6-467b-a958-71de513aa831","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:34:50.151Z","request_id":"req_011CghyWdtr8ecrUfbJuNp11"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyWeK9TFDgKo8XWvb6u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TN4U2UKfirEX6DDHS11BUu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/12-data-story.js'; s=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\"); j=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Testing feedback'\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\n    'The plan\\\\'s balance targets (section 14.5) are not met. Measured on 16 campaigns each: AI-only campaigns last 9.2 seasons on average (target 12 to 16) and no realm wins more than 40%. The player on autoplay wins 31% of campaigns (target 60%, reaching Meridian between seasons 10 and 14). Battles average 11.7 bells (target 8 or fewer in early battles). Hub seat win rates were not measured.',\n    'The dev sliders (rival aggression, player mana, battle damage, defenders\\\\' guard, knight experience and the rest) are the place to tune these. The defaults are a first tuning, not a finished one.'] },\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\ns=s.replace(\"'Testing: 539 headless checks\",\"'Testing: 546 headless checks\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs | tail -1 && (node tests/run.mjs --browser > /tmp/brig-final4.txt 2>&1; echo \"exit $?\" >> /tmp/brig-final4.txt) & sleep 2; echo started","description":"Record the measured balance honestly in the About text and start the final browser run"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_read_input_tokens":861280,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1