{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyfFq3iRzJ8isYFGzWs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook is right that the balance targets are part of the plan, and I can measure them, so I'll keep tuning rather than stop. Three levers are still untested: battle damage, which should shorten battles; rival aggression, where 0.4 gave the length target before; and how the autoplay player attacks Meridian. I'll add tunable parameters to the battle-length tool and measure battle damage first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2932,"cache_read_input_tokens":866057,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2932},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"fdb24cb5-75fe-42b2-829c-9f673b5c3592","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:36:48.127Z","request_id":"req_011CghyfFREvzA4iBsgsmmoh"}
