{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyjZP6k1nWXHVFuUZtx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The player still almost never takes Meridian. The cause is structural: a march sends one knight, while Meridian's garrison of a Gray Knight, Ashen and monsters is worth far more. I'll let several knights march on the same castle together as one army, the way the plan's troops do. Then the autoplay player can mass its knights from adjacent castles against a strong target."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1113,"cache_read_input_tokens":871710,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1113},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"775ba1ee-ba33-45b6-a50a-461b1cc80afc","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:37:49.995Z","request_id":"req_011CghyjYyJAZP8kUmLuj18F"}
