{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghz89MsTGMhWqB7hzMbA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Meridian has no garrison at all by season two. Two things drain it. The CPU's reinforce step moves the Gray Knight and Ashen out to castles that border enemies, and upkeep makes the Dominion's monsters desert, since the Dominion spends more on them than it earns. I'll keep the Dominion's knights at Meridian, and make the Hourless creatures cost no upkeep, as the story suggests."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1035,"cache_read_input_tokens":903666,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1035},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"0a8f4211-1f4a-4b71-9ba3-a03d534c99a9","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:42:50.744Z","request_id":"req_011Cghz88q8H5B8iqibcN4Uf"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghz89MsTGMhWqB7hzMbA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PLmKmxBZ1zAoiu2aCxthGe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef patch(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        c=s.count(a); assert c==1,(p,c,a[:90]); s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\npatch('src/23-ai-campaign.js', [\n (\"      if (k.realm !== realm || k.state !== 'ready' || s.marches.some(m => m.knight === k.id)) continue;\\n      if (k.id === H.get('realm', realm).ruler) continue;\\n      const here = k.castle;\",\n  \"      if (k.realm !== realm || k.state !== 'ready' || s.marches.some(m => m.knight === k.id)) continue;\\n      if (k.id === H.get('realm', realm).ruler) continue;\\n      if (k.castle === 'meridian') continue;   // the Calendar City keeps its wardens\\n      const here = k.castle;\"),\n])\npatch('src/22-sim-campaign.js', [\n (\"        const upkeep = (m) => Math.max(1, Math.round(H.get('species', m.species).forms[m.form].cost * 6 * H.tune.upkeep));\",\n  \"        // the Hourless creatures cost no upkeep: they are not kept by mana\\n        const upkeep = (m) => r.id === 'dominion' ? 0 : Math.max(1, Math.round(H.get('species', m.species).forms[m.form].cost * 6 * H.tune.upkeep));\"),\n])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs | tail -1 && for c in \"3 1 0.5\" \"3 1 0.8\"; do set -- $c; echo \"== summonCost=$1 upkeep=$2 rivalAggression=$3\"; timeout 100 node tools/simulate-campaign.mjs 8 ai summonCost=$1 upkeep=$2 rivalAggression=$3 2>&1 | tail -4 | tr '\\n' ' '; echo; done","description":"Keep the Dominion's wardens at Meridian and exempt Hourless creatures from upkeep"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1035,"cache_read_input_tokens":903666,"cache_creation":{"ephemera