{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghzcuXyGe3qecWSSt2yZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YXMXUzXwi1SN7occEcjUpH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\np='src/12-data-story.js'; s=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\"); j=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Testing feedback'\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\n    'The plan\\\\'s balance targets (section 14.5) are not met. Measured with the current defaults, 12 campaigns each: AI-only campaigns last 12.0 seasons on average (target 12 to 16), and no realm takes Meridian, so no realm wins more than 40% (met, but only because the contest never resolves). The player on autoplay reaches Meridian in 0 of 12 (target: 60%, between seasons 10 and 14). Battles average 11.7 bells (target 8 or fewer in early battles). Hub seat win rates were not measured.',\n    'The cause is the knights: they grow only through battle, so an autoplay army of level-two knights cannot beat Meridian\\\\'s garrison. The dev sliders (player mana, summon cost, upkeep, rival aggression, battle damage, defenders\\\\' guard, knight experience) are the place to tune it; I did not find a setting that meets the targets without changing how knights grow.'] },\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\ns=s.replace(\"'Testing: 546 headless checks\",\"'Testing: 546 headless checks\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs | tail -1 && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\np='/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/exit-interview.json'\nd=json.load(open(p))\nd['promptFeedback'][2]=\"Keeping the scope honest. Every feature the brief names is built, and the plan's mechanics, sound-effect list and content counts are built too. The plan's balance targets are not met on measurement: AI-only campaigns are at the length target, but the player on autoplay never takes Meridian. I report that as unfinished.\"\nd['testingFeedback'][0]=\"Fourteen issues across all rounds. Nine in the first round (seven broke play, two cosmetic); two in the hub harness; three in the playthroughs and review (a campaign that never advanced its season, a battle that could not restart after its rival lines, and a Keep rule that fired mid-move). Balance work this round exposed further economy problems: upkeep, Meridian's garrison, and knights that wandered from their castles.\"\njson.dump(d,open(p,'w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\nx=json.load(open(p)); print('parses', len(x['testingFeedback']), len(x['engineFeedback']), len(x['promptFeedback']), [k for k,v in x['sourceInformation'].items() if not v])\nEOF","description":"Record the measured balance in the About text and exit interview, then validate"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":435,"cache_read_input_tokens":932202,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":435},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"f3d15245-3379-49e1-b4d8-677cb7b27977","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:49:23.265Z","request_id":"req_011Cghzcu7RvDhHn57UM15cL","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01YXMXUzXwi1SN7occEcjUpH":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050229 && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\np='src/12-data-story.js'; s=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\"); j=s.index(\"  { heading: 'Testing feedback'\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"  { heading: 'Not built', lines: [\n    'The plan\\\\'s balance targets (section 14.5) are not met. Measured with the current defaults, 12 campaigns each: AI-only campaigns last 12.0 seasons on average (target 12 to 16), and no realm takes Meridian, so no realm wins more than 40% (met, but only because the contest never resolves). The player on autoplay reaches Meridian in 0 of 12 (target: 60%, between seasons 10 and 14). Battles average 11.7 bells (target 8 or fewer in early battles). Hub seat win rates were not measured.',\n    'The cause is the knights: they grow only through battle, so an autoplay army of level-two knights cannot beat Meridian\\\\'s garrison. The dev sliders (player mana, summon cost, upkeep, rival aggression, battle damage, defenders\\\\' guard, knight experience) are the place to tune it; I did not find a setting that meets the targets without changing how knights grow.'] },\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\ns=s.replace(\"'Testing: 546 headless checks\",\"'Testing: 546 headless checks\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs | tail -1 && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\np='/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/exit-interview.json'\nd=json.load(open(p))\nd['promptFeedback'][2]=\"Keeping the scope honest. Every feature the brief names is built, and the plan's mechanics, sound-effect list and content counts are built too. The plan's balance targets are not met on measurement: AI-only campaigns are at the length target, but the player on autoplay never takes Meridian. I report that as unfinished.\"\nd['testingFeedback'][0]=\"Fourteen issues across all rounds. Nine in the first round (seven broke play, two cosmetic); two in the hub harness; three in the playthroughs and review (a campaign that never advanced its season, a battle that could not restart after its rival lines, and a Keep rule that fired mid-move). Balance work this round exposed further economy problems: upkeep, Meridian's garrison, and knights that wandered from their castles.\"\njson.dump(d,open(p,'w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\nx=json.load(open(p)); print('parses', len(x['testingFeedback']), len(x['engineFeedback']), len(x['promptFeedback']), [k for k,v in x['sourceInformation'].items() if not v])\nEOF","description":"Record the measured balance in the About text and exit interview, then validate"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01YXMXUzXwi1SN7occEcjUpH":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-050229__x7910ab/work/BrigantimeTheLegendOfForseasons-BrigandineTheLegendOfForsena-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050229"}}}
