{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghzqx96rBSQHA9YsZgbQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the cause is clear. The Dominion's ruler, Vesper, marches on Mossgate with a large monster army, and Oren has only one slime to defend with. Two of my earlier choices enable this: the Dominion's monsters have no upkeep, and CPU rulers march at the same odds as any knight. I'll make Dominion monsters pay upkeep like everyone else's, and make CPU rulers march only with overwhelming odds, as the autoplay ruler does."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1347,"cache_read_input_tokens":948087,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1347},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b593beda-ab71-4ff5-909e-67cc1a56f914","uuid":"93edb1ab-6d4c-4d62-ba8c-93cf40b7beee","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:52:18.474Z","request_id":"req_011CghzqwacYpiLZhwY6Tiaj"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghzqx96rBSQHA9YsZgbQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PcsCSmUXDMn1hweYgGhcUu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef patch(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        c=s.count(a); assert c==1,(p,c,a[:80]); s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\npatch('src/22-sim-campaign.js', [\n (\"        // the Hourless creatures cost no upkeep: they are not kept by mana\\n        const upkeep = (m) => r.id === 'dominion' ? 0 : Math.max(1,\",\n  \"        const upkeep = (m) => Math.max(1,\"),\n])\npatch('src/23-ai-campaign.js', [\n (\"      for (const c of sim.adjacentCastles(k.castle)) {\\n        if (s.castles[c].owner === realm) continue;\\n        const enemy = strength(sim, c), own = ownStrength(sim, k) * aggression;\\n        if (own < enemy * .9) continue;\",\n  \"      // a ruler marches only with overwhelming odds: a fallen ruler ends its realm's game\\n      const ruler = k.id === H.get('realm', realm).ruler;\\n      for (const c of sim.adjacentCastles(k.castle)) {\\n        if (s.castles[c].owner === realm) continue;\\n        const enemy = strength(sim, c), own = ownStrength(sim, k) * aggression;\\n        if (own < enemy * (ruler ? 2.2 : .9)) continue;\"),\n])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && node tests/run.mjs | tail -1 && echo \"== player\"; timeout 100 node tools/simulate-campaign.mjs 8 player 2>&1 | tail -4 | tr '\\n' ' '; echo; echo \"== AI\"; timeout 100 node tools/simulate-campaign.mjs 8 ai 2>&1 | tail -4 | tr '\\n' ' '; echo","description":"Give Dominion monsters upkeep, hold rulers back in CPU marches, and measure"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1347,"cache_read_input_tokens":948087,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_in